@startuml
title G10 - Donnees et source de verite

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "G10 API Gateway" as G10
database "Aucune base utilisateurs locale\nG10 ne stocke pas users/roles/tokens" as NoDb

component "G3 Gestion utilisateurs" as G3
database "User DB\npropriete G3" as UserDb

rectangle "users\n--\nid\nemail\npasswordHash\nroles\nenabled\nemailVerified" as users
rectangle "refresh_tokens\n--\nid\ntokenHash\nuserId\nrevoked\nexpiresAt" as refresh
rectangle "email_verification_tokens\n--\nid\ntokenHash\nuserId\nexpiresAt" as verify
rectangle "password_reset_tokens\n--\nid\ntokenHash\nuserId\nexpiresAt" as reset

G10 .. NoDb
G10 --> G3 : route /auth/**\nvalidate JWT signed by G3
G3 --> UserDb
UserDb -- users
users --> refresh : 1..*
users --> verify : 1..*
users --> reset : 1..*

note bottom of G10
G10 peut avoir des logs techniques sur fichier,
mais pas de base metier utilisateurs.
end note

@enduml
